WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:02.810
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.920
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.290
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.020
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.320
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.090
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.090
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.090
<b>Xros Heart (Team Taiki)</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.090
<b>Team Twilight</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.090
<b>Team Blue Flare</b>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.090
Protagonist

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.090
Rival

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:18.960
And now we've arrived 
in the Shinobi Zone.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:27.990
<b>Shinobi Zone,</b>

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:27.990
<b>the Comic Ninja Battle!</b>

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.740
Shinobi Zone, the Comic Ninja Battle!

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.310
So you have made it...

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:33.160
to the Shinobi Zone.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.850
Shinobi Zone?

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:40.250
So many Monitamons!

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:43.310
Elder.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.860
It has been a long time.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.980
Ah, what a nostalgic gathering.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:55.330
The Shinobi Zone is our 
homeland, Miss Nene.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.000
Homeland?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.290
Monitamons are born here, train here,

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:03.610
and the most competent 
ones are deployed.

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:06.240
You guys are elites?

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:13.250
I have heard of all that Xros Heart 
has done through the monitors.

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:19.420
Lousy image quality...

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:22.050
I am sorry.

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:25.000
The only ones remaining here now 
are those with poor performance.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.070
Well, anyway, if Nene can 
rest here, it's okay.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.900
I'm afraid that is impossible.

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.070
What do you mean?

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.440
Just a short time ago, this Zone 
was attacked by the Bagra Army,

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.180
and our castle was taken.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:42.680
What? The Bagra Army 
took the Monita Castle?

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:58.750
Now that we have the Monita Castle,

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.060
I can finally watch the human 
world's historical dramas!

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.130
And? Have the Monitamons brought

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.870
the Shinobi Zone's Code Crown yet?

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.540
Not yet...

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.510
Kirisute Gomen!

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:17.120
Unless you want me to hit you next time,

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:18.580
make them bring it immediately!

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.150
Y-Yes, sir!

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:30.430
Sneaky steps. Stealthy steps.
 Silent steps. Go!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:34.070
Sneaky steps, stealthy steps, silent steps...

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.820
What are you doing?!

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.480
Next, hiding among the leaves!

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.610
H-He disappeared...

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:48.680
Hiding among the leaves!

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.570
Can't breathe!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.050
Art of water escape!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.330
Art of water escape!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.070
Help!

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.470
What's wrong with these guys?

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:13.690
This is why the castle fell and 
our princess was kidnapped.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:16.470
This Zone's princess was kidnapped?

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:19.550
Mushamon's army said that 
if we want her back,

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:22.380
we have to bring them the Code Crown.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.480
Princess...

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.400
Princess!

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:28.810
I'll come save you right away!

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.420
I'm waiting!

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.860
It's all right. I'm sure she's safe.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.980
<i>DarkKnightmon, where is my brother?</i>

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.220
<i>Where is Yuu?</i>

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.270
<i>Give Yuu back to me!</i>

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:43.900
<i>That's right... Nene's 
brother is also...</i>

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.710
Do you have the Code Crown yet?

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.640
Please give us just a little more time!

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.770
I cannot wait any longer!

00:03:58.620 --> 00:03:59.390
You...

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:03.890
We are doing our best 
to get the Code Crown.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:06.360
Why is it taking so long?

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:11.510
Obtaining the Shinobi Zone's 
Code Crown is a difficult task!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.230
No excuses!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.900
Momiji Oroshi!

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:17.340
Sparrowmon!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.780
There are still those among 
you who would defy me?!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.110
Lord Shurimon, I understand your anger,

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.210
but in consideration of this, 
please give us more time.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.340
<b>The Youngster's Close Call</b>

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:33.920
I picked up this new historical drama.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.920
I heard that Lord Mushamon loves these.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:40.020
Very well. I will give 
you until tomorrow.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.820
You will bring it then, without fail.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:46.760
If you delay, you and your princess 
are all as good as dead.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.940
Thank you for saving us!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:56.970
I can't forgive those who use 
others' lives to shield themselves.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.640
Stupid Bagra Army!

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:01.560
Do you know where the Code Crown is?

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:07.050
We know, but we aren't letting 
Mushamon's army know that.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.660
Okay. I understand.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.270
Then let's go get the 
Code Crown right now

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.490
and save the princess!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:13.860
But...

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:18.130
Don't worry! Leave this to the future
Digimon King and his General!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:18.660
Yeah!

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.480
I'll go, too.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:23.500
Nene, you should stay here and rest!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.900
You guys can't be relied upon alone.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.210
But...

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:30.480
Why not? I'll stay with Nene.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:34.210
Okay, Akari, take care of Nene.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.250
Leave it to me!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:35.890
Yeah!

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.790
Historical dramas really fire me up!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.950
I've made them promise to bring 
the Code Crown by tomorrow,

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.170
so please watch at your 
leisure while you wait.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.700
You'd better make sure 
they keep their promise.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.650
I must get the Code Crown to Lord Blastmon,

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:04.240
or he'll have my head!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:05.780
Yes, sir!

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.640
What is it?

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.380
It appears the Monitamons

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:12.680
have no intention of handing 
over the Code Crown.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.420
What?!

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:17.790
Then we will have to come 
up with a plan of our own.

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:19.700
I understand.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.720
Taiki, wouldn't it be 
faster to knock out

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.140
the Bagra Army who took the castle?

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:34.900
That would put the princess in danger.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.440
If we do fight,

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:39.680
we'll have to use the Code 
Crown as a shield, or as bait.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:46.450
A Digimon called Karatenmon 
has the Code Crown.

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:48.090
So we just have to defeat him?

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.200
Uh, no... what we must do

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.920
may be even more difficult 
than defeating him.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:53.860
What do you mean?

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:58.320
I'll tell you when we reach the shrine 
where Master Karatenmon resides.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.260
Are you okay?

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.770
I'm fine.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.070
Are you sure?

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:47.760
Why are you so worried about me?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:53.580
Well, it seems like you're bearing 
so much all by yourself...

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:57.290
You're worried about your 
brother, aren't you?

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:00.080
I have younger brothers, too, 
so I sort of understand.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.740
So if you want to risk yourself 
to save the princess,

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.890
because she's being held 
captive just like him...

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.440
That's not why.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:14.790
I'm sorry if I was too presumptuous.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.230
But if there's anything I 
can do, just tell me, okay?

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:30.650
Master Karatenmon lives 
at the top of this cliff.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.250
We'll get hurt climbing that thing...

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.570
Fidget, twitch, squirm...

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:37.570
Don't you have any good ideas, Taiki?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.120
Yes! I got it!

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:53.230
Shoutmon!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:54.520
Sparrowmon!

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:56.440
DigiXros!

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:58.080
Jet Sparrow!

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:01.610
Yay!

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:03.500
Ready to go, Taiki!

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.180
Everyone grab on!

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.810
You too, Nene.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.080
Nene!

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:32.560
I'll save Nene with my breaststroke!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.010
What about me?!

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:35.880
Shoutmon! Use Air Shooter!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:36.870
Right!

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.150
Air Shooter!

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.970
Are you okay, Nene?

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:52.000
Thanks.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.560
But you're too close.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:57.270
The pain... is this love sickness?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.390
I'm literally hanging for 
my life from a cliff!

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:05.240
Nope, can't...

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:06.980
Zenjirou!

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:09.060
Farewell, Nene...

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:18.320
Thank goodness!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.060
You okay?

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:22.360
Yes! I'm just fine!

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:23.730
Who are you guys?

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.900
Lend me that mic, will ya?

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.440
Everyone listen up!

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.600
We are the Etemon!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.990
We're Digimon with...

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.660
Boss!

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:35.720
rockin' spirits!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:36.910
Boss!

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:36.910
Yeah!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.310
Yeah.

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:39.900
Gimme back my mic.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:43.010
Looks like you have the light of a star.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.350
A star?!

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:45.150
I'm the star!

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:48.100
I'm more a king than a star!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.890
I'm aiming to become the Digimon King!

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.330
King?!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.480
Now that's awesome! Rock!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.130
Master Taiki, we must keep moving.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.130
Yeah.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.080
Well, thanks, Boss.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.700
Later!

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:07.170
Why are you following us?

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:09.170
We're your fans now!

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:10.040
Fans?

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:14.230
We'll follow you anywhere, 
future Digimon King! Yeah!

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.050
You really do get it, don't you?

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.880
They're all talk.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.820
I don't trust them.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:22.750
It's okay if they come 
with us, right, Taiki?

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.620
Well, they did save Zenjirou...

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.340
They don't seem like bad Digimon.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:29.130
You're right.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:32.410
No road is long with good company!

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:34.370
Thank you, baby! Yeah!

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:35.970
You trust too easily.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:41.030
I don't think I've ever seen Nene smile.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.290
I wish I could cheer her up somehow...

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:45.680
but what can I do?

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:48.330
Hey, you're just like me.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.000
You can't turn your back on her.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.800
Don't put me on your level.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:53.840
Aww...

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:57.960
But I think if anyone could 
get Nene to open up, it's you.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.090
Taiki...

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:05.460
That is Master Karatenmon's shrine.

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:12.500
Now!

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.350
Karatenmon is here?

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:22.180
Where?

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.150
Right there.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.290
That's Karatenmon?

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.340
I have been waiting for you...

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:41.400
Digimon of the Shinobi Village.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:45.540
We need the Code Crown 
to rescue the princess!

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:47.910
Then I shall challenge you.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.410
Challenge?

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:57.420
We must make Master Karatenmon laugh.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.250
Excuse me?

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.650
The Shinobi Zone's Code Crown

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.770
can be obtained only by one 
who makes its owner laugh.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:05.100
Huh?!

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:06.770
What?!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.900
We have shown him many 
amusing videos ourselves...

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:26.090
But Master Karatenmon would not laugh.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.980
How can we make him laugh?

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:30.150
Right! I'll do it!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.350
Zenjirou's totally going to fall flat.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.200
It's not like I'm skiing!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.170
Here I go!

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:37.970
What do you put on pork cutlets?

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.560
Sooo... y'see?

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.960
"Sauce!" Get it? 
<i>Soy</i> that's what it means!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.110
Okay, I will now do my 
Blastmon impression!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.870
Okay, that's enough.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.440
But it sounds just like him...

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:53.210
We're next!

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.140
Fire Shot!

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:57.120
Water Dragon!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.410
Wind Wheel!

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:02.510
Weak...

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.480
Those are just attacks.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.940
Now it's my turn!

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.430
Yo! Best in Japan!

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:08.730
Taiki's so cool!

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.020
Taiki! Taiki!

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:11.880
I've got it!

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:13.410
That's my General!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.090
It's all up to us now!

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:16.410
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.530
DigiXros number 1!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.810
Shoutmon and Jijimon make...

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:22.550
JijiShoutmon!

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:25.990
Huh?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.010
DigiXros number 2!

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.480
Cutemon and Shoutmon make...

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:32.040
ShouCutemon!

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:35.260
This is awful!

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:36.680
Grr...

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.880
No good? Then how about this?!

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:40.890
Shounitamon!

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.590
DonShoutomon!

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.660
PawnShoutmon!

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.720
Ow!

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.860
Wow, Nene finally laughed!

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:55.400
Huh?

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:57.180
It's been bugging me.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.800
I realized I'd never seen you smile.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:06.730
It's no use...

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.920
The one who makes him laugh 
gets the Code Crown, right?

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:14.590
Peek!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.920
Eyes under the eyes!

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:20.160
Argh! I've had enough!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.730
How can we make Karatenmon laugh?

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.630
Anyone else have any...

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.280
Sorry, I got nothing.

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:37.250
Akari, any ideas?

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:38.210
Huh? Me?

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.480
You used to watch a lot 
of comedy shows, right?

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.020
All right, I'll try!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:48.350
But what should I do...

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.790
I know!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:52.060
Pineapple!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.740
Okay, then... um...

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:56.760
How about a staring contest?

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.310
Okay, Akari, that's enough.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:01.020
But if we don't get the Code Crown,

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:02.770
we can't save the princess!

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:05.870
Miss Akari...

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.880
I'll do it.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:11.880
Nene?

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:12.410
You will?

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.320
But I can't do it by myself.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.210
I'll need your help.

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:20.320
You said to tell you if there was 
anything you could do, right?

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:25.370
Here we go! Our skit: "Mother!"

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:28.680
Chop, chop...

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.560
Mom, is dinner ready yet?

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.230
Did you wash your hands?

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.370
I don't feel like it.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:36.570
Do as your mother says!

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:38.720
Yes, mom!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.110
Yes, mom... like "yes, ma'am!"

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.110
<b>Mom</b>

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:46.010
Nene took the fall...

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:50.070
What's today's date again?

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.150
It's the seventh.

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:52.780
Seventastic!

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:56.290
What is Karatenmon's talent?

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:59.060
Osu! Totally karate, mon!

00:17:59.060 --> 00:17:59.570
Apple...

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:00.230
Chop!

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:01.430
Apple...

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.100
Chop!

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:03.250
Apple...

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:03.920
Chop!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:12.440
I have lost. Take it.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.320
The Code Crown!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:16.770
I guess that last one 
hit his funny bone?

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.070
You're kidding...

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.370
Nene, you're awesome!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.020
Shuriken!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.780
Yeah! I'll take this!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:25.380
What?!

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:31.390
We are Lord Shurimon's 
shadow ninja army!

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:33.510
You tricked us?! You'll pay for that!

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:37.640
Ballistamon!

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:39.560
Bastemon!

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:41.270
DigiXros!

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:48.670
BalliBastemon!

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:51.140
Taiki, you don't have to 
make people laugh anymore!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:52.710
Here I go!

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.310
Belly Balli Dance!

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:58.950
Belly, belly... Balli, 
Balli... dance, dance!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.050
Belly, belly... Balli, 
Balli... dance, dance!

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:05.620
Belly, belly... Balli, 
Balli... dance, dance!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.760
Love Serenade!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.630
We are the Etemon!

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:15.460
Making a killing as rockin' ninjas!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.050
Ow, my ears!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.050
Cat Speaker!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:21.870
A boulder?! It's true "rock!"

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:26.040
This BalliBastemon thing actually works!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:26.760
Now!

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:28.480
Starmon!

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.280
Yes!

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:30.270
Pickmons!

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.550
Yay!

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:33.480
DigiXros!

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.460
How dare you trick us?!

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.540
Star Blade!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:47.430
How could I be defeated 
by these chumps?!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:49.570
Rock and roll!

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.280
Thank you so much.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.600
It's all thanks to Akari and Nene.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:06.780
I just couldn't turn 
my back on you guys.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:10.070
You're not very dependable, 
and you're abnormally good-hearted.

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:11.660
Thanks, Miss Nene.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.030
You can call me Nene.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.660
Okay! Thanks, Nene!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:21.140
Now that I think about it,

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:24.100
how did Karatenmon make the 
Code Crown's previous owner laugh?

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:25.990
Well...

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:32.210
Oh, no! Don't look at me!

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:32.210
Are you kidding me?!

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.980
It's especially funny 
coming from someone

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:37.550
who never does stuff like that!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:39.410
That's right!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.020
You didn't record me, did you?

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:44.170
Uh, yes...

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:47.360
All right, let's go rescue the princess!

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:50.290
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:54.630
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:58.170
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:58.170
Digimon Data Collection!

