00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:11.050
<b>Undead Type</b>

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:14.530
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:14.510
<b>Ground Zero</b>

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:13.920
Are you getting enough calcium?

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:14.520
<b>Undead T</b>

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:18.920
Time to save the princess!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:22.690
Wait, Zenjirou, Dorulumon, and 
the Monitamons are going?!

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:24.630
Zenjirou's been fighting 
with us all this time.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:25.610
He'll be fine!

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:27.400
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.350
<b>The Underachieving Monitamons</b>

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.400
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:29.350
<b>Give It Their All!</b>
